<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Lughuru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Muh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Muhubili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Muhubili</para>
  <para style="mt">MUHUBILI</para>
  <para style="imt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu achino cha Muhubili cholangulitsa ukakala na ihekima. Litaghwa lya Chieburaniya lya ichitabu acho mana yake, “Imunu iyoweka hamwe iwanu.” Iwasomi wengi wotoghola ka Mfalume Selemani yuyo iyandike ichitabu achino, lekeni wangi ng'awotoghola baye. Mfalume Selemani tsakakala mna imiyaka 970-931, ng'ana Kiristu yoneke baye, apfo yeye yuyo iyandike ichitabu acho, lekeni iwasomi wangi wotoghola ka tsachandikighwa na munu yungi kwaapfila ichitabu achino chandikighwa kwa ilugha ya iwaatumighwa na si kwa lugha ya wafalume baye (Muubili 5.8-9). Iwasomi wangi wofikitsa ka ichitabu cha Muhubili tsachandikighwa hambele na si mna ghamatsuwa gha Selemani baye, songaa mna imiyaka ya 400 na 200, Kiristu ng'ana yoneke baye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhubili kakwandusa ukulonga ka chila chinu cheghala na libeho lisumka ukuhupa. (1.2) mana yake ugima wetu na tsisang'ano tsetu tsohupa na ng'atudaha baye ukumanya. Pfinu pfingi pfitsosemighwa ghang'abita matsuwa madodo, na pfinu pfingi ng'atudaha baye ukupfighoma. Ng'apfu ukale ka pfauli na udeng'elele achila chawinacho (9.9). Ichitabu chomalitsila kwa kutulongela apfino mna ugima kuna ukughaya na kuna ukudeng'ele, na chinu chikulu ghendo kobamighwa umpfuke Imulungu na ukinde malaghitso ghake (12.13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">1. Ichitabu achino cholangusa imunu iyandike ichitabu na kotulongela aghala ghayamanyile hayakalile mgima isula ya 1.1-11.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Pfipfila ichitabu achino cholangusa mana ya ugima isula ya 1.12-69.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Pfipfila ichitabu chotulongela yeye pfayakona isula ya 6.10-12,8</para>
  <para style="io">4 Pfipfila ichitabu chotulongela ukumpfuka Imulungu na ukukinda malaghitso ghake isula ya 12.9-14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Ugima si chinu baye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Aghano ghagho ghayalongile Muhubili imwana wa Daudi, ayo Daudi tsa mfalume ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Muhubili kolonga chila chinu bule ghendo mna ghamatsuwa aghano ghanikala mgima! <verse eid="ECC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Angu munu yopata choni kwa isang'ano yake iyohenyeka mna isi aino? <verse eid="ECC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Mweleko ghopfosa, mweleko ghwakutsa, lekeni isi yokala pfipfo matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="ECC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Litsuwa lyolawa, na lyakuswa, kuya lyosumka ukughenda akula kwalilawila. <verse eid="ECC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Libeho lyodumila kusini, na lyodumila kasikazini, lyoduma na kuduma keli, aku lyakuiyila keli ghumtsunguluko ghwake. <verse eid="ECC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Imito yose yakwingila mna ibahali, lekeni ibahali ng'aimema baye, na ghamatsi ghakuya akula kwayanzile imito, na baho ghakuya keli mna ibahali. <verse eid="ECC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Ipfinu pfose pfomtenda imunu yepfe, kubita pfayodaha ukulonga. Inenge ng'aikwipfa baye ukulola, wala lighutwi ng'alikwipfa baye ukuhulika. <verse eid="ECC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Ighali bahano ghagho ighatsakuwa baho, ighatendeke ghagho ighatsotendeka keli, kuduhu chinu ichili cha sambi mna isi. <verse eid="ECC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Pfihi hana chinu chochose iwanu chawodaha kulonga, “Lola, chinu achino cha sambi?” Baye, tsachabaho kulawa ghumwande ahala twetwe ng'ana twoneke. <verse eid="ECC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Kuduhu munu yokumbuka gha ghumwande, na awala iwatsakoneka hambele ng'awatsoghakumbuka baye igholawila sambi na hambele.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfayakona Muhubili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Nene Muhubili tsanikala namfalume wa Isiraeli ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Kwa ihekima yangu yose tsanibama nimanye chila chinu ichilawila mna isi aino na Imlungu pfayaweng'ile iwanu maghayo makulu. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Nighona ghose ighotendighwa mna isi, agho ghose si chinu baye, gheghala na ukuwinga libeho. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Ichinu ichipfeduke ng'achidahika baye ukuchigholosa, na aghala ing'aghali baho ng'aghodahika baye ukupeteka. <verse eid="ECC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Nifikitsa nilongela mwenyegho, “Lola nyongetseka ihekima kubita iwanu wose iwanilongole kutawala ako Yerusalemu. Ghumoyo ghwangu ghumema ihekima na ukumanya.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Tsanibama nimanye pfayili ihekima, ukwalekwale na ubotsi, lekeni tsanitanga ka ukutenda apfo kweghala na ukuwinga libeho. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Kwaapfila ihekima ing'ongetseka yoghala ukwalangula, na ukumanya kung'ongetseka, usungu wakongetseka.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Apfo nilongela mwenyegho, “Leka nighetse chila chinu ichinitenda nideng'elele.” Lekeni mbona ukutenda apfo nako si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Nilonga, “Ukuseka nako ubotsi, angu ukudeng'elela nako kuna choni?” <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Tsanifikitsa mna ghumoyo ghwangu nilole pfanidaha kulusangalamsa lukuli lwangu kwa kunwa imbwali, akuno ghumoyo ghwangu ghung'ali ghulongotsighwa na ihekima. Tsanibama mbone chinu chachi chinoghile iwanu chawobamighwa ukutenda kwa ghamatsuwa madodo ghawokala muisi. <verse eid="ECC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Tsanitenda pfinu pfikulu, nitsengela mang'anda na nilima mighunda ya minzabibu, <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />tsanitendela bostani na imighunda, kuko nihanda chila mbiki ghwa matunda. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Nihimba matsimbu gha ghamatsi ili nighelele imibiki ayo. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Nighula watumwa, wapinga na wamale na wangi tsawonekela mng'anda mwangu. Tsanikala na mali nyingi, ng'ombe, ng'olo na mene kubita imunu wowose iyanilongolele kukala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Nilundikila fetsa na nzahabu kulawa kuna tsihatsina tsa wafalume na kuna tsiisi. Tsanipata iwanu iwakwimba wamale na wapinga na wapinga iwanitendile nideng'elele ng'ani. <verse eid="ECC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Tsanikala munu mkulu iyomanyika ng'ani kubita wose iwanilongolele kukala Yerusalemu, mna ghose aghano nighendelela kuwa na ihekima yangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Chila chinu chanibamile tsanichipata, na tsanitenda chila chinu ichideng'elesa ghumoyo ghwangu, kwaaapfila ghumoyo ghwangu tsaghudeng'elela, na alino tsalikala ghweko lya tsisang'ano tsangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Kuya nifikitsa ghose ghanitendile na ghamaghayo ghanipatile kwa tsisang'ano atso. Lekeni nitanga agho ghose si chinu baye, gheghala na ukuwinga libeho, wala kuduhu chochose chanipata mna isi. <verse eid="ECC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Kuya nyandusa kwipfikitsa ihekima, lukwale na ubotsi chinu chachi? Nighutsa nimwenyegho “Mfalume yang'amalitsa ukutawala, imunu iyosola hanu hake kobamighwa yatende choni ing'achina chitendeke?” <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Baho mbona ihekima inogha kubita ubotsi, ka apfila ghumwanga pfaghunoghile kubita ichisi. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Imunu iyana ihekima kotumila ka pfayotumila tsinenge, kakwona kwoghenda, lekeni imunu mbotsi koghenda mna ichisi. Hata apfo nitanga ka imunu yana ihekima na imbotsi wose wohupila lumwe. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Kuya nilongela mna ghumoyo ghwangu, “Ghatsompata imunu mbotsi pfipfila ghatsonipata nene, apfo ning'awa na ihekima iyongetseke nitsopata choni?” Nifikitsa nilonga, “Agho nagho si chinu ghendo baye.” <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Kwaapfila kuduhu iyomkumbuka yana ihekima, wala imbotsi, mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa wose watsosemwighwa, mana pfayakufa imunu yana ihekima pfipfo pfayatsakufa imunu mbotsi! <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Apfo niwihila ugima, kwaapfila ighatendeke mna isi tsanighona gheha kuna nene. Ghose tsaghakala si chinu baye, gheghala na ukuwinga libeho. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Chila chinu chanisang'ane mna isi aino tsanichona chiha, kwaapfila tsanibamighwa nimlekele imunu iyakutsa hachughu hangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Kuya yuhi yomanya ka katsakuwa na hekima au katsakuwa mbotsi? Ghose ghanisang'ane kwa ihekima yangu mna isi aino ghatsakuwa ghake, alyo nalyo si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Apfo ghumoyo ghwangu ghutenyuka kwa tsisang'ano tsose tsanitendile kwa ukuhenyeka mna isi. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Mana imunu kodaha kusang'ana ing'onde yake kwa ihekima, ukumanya na tsimbutsi, kuya kobamighwa yamlekele imunu yungi yang'apfisang'anile pfose pfayali napfo. Pfipfila alyo nalyo si chinu baye, nalyo liha ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Angu imunu yopata choni kwa tsisang'ano tsake tsayotenda kwa ukuhenyeka mna isi? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Kwaapfila matsuwa ghake ghose kosang'ana kwa ukughaya, na ukudununzika, hata nechilo ng'obwihila baye ukwalangula. Alyo nalyo si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Kuduhu chinu ichinoghile kwa imunu, ila ukuja na ukunwa, na ukudeng'elela sang'ano yake. Alyo nalyo nilyona lyolawa kwa Imulungu, <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />kwaapfila bila Yeye, yuhi iyodaha ukuja na ukudeng'elela? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Mana Imulungu komwing'a imunu iyomnoghela, ihekima, tsimbutsi na indeng'elo, lekeni komwing'a imunu yana tsinzambi sang'ano ya ukukunga na ukumemetsa, kuya komwing'a iyomnoghela yeye. Alyo nalyo si chinu ghendo, leghala na ukuwinga libeho.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Chila chinu na chipindi chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Chila chinu ichilawila muisi, cholawila mna chipindi chayekile Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Keka chipindi cha ukwelekighwa na chipindi cha ukufa, chipindi cha ukuhanda na chipindi cha ukupfuna. <verse eid="ECC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Pfipfila keka chipindi cha ukukoma, na chipindi cha ukuhonetsa, chipindi cha ukumwagha na chipindi cha ukutsenga, <verse eid="ECC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />chipindi cha ukulila na chipindi cha ukuseka, chipindi cha ukudomboketsa na chipindi cha ukupfina. <verse eid="ECC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Kuya keka chipindi cha ukwasa ghamabwe na ichipindi cha ukudondola ghamabwe, ichipindi cha ukuhabatila na chipindi cha kuleka kuhabatila. <verse eid="ECC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />chipindi cha ukubama na chipindi cha ukwaghisa, chipindi cha kwika ghoya na chipindi cha ukwasa, <verse eid="ECC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />chipindi cha ukudegha na chipindi cha ukudadatsa, chipindi cha ukwinyamala tulu na ichipindi cha ukulonga, <verse eid="ECC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />chipindi cha ukukunda na chipindi cha ukwihila, chipindi cha ing'ondo na ichipindi cha ukukala tseghamba. <verse eid="ECC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Angu imunu iyosang'ana ng'onde ng'omu yopata choni kwa ing'onde yake? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Nene mbona sang'ano ng'omu imunu yeng'ighwe ne Imulungu yaihenyekele. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Imulungu katenda chila chinu chinoghile kwa chipindi chake. Kamtenda imunu yabame ukumanya ipfinu ipfitsolawila hambele, lekeni imunu ayo ng'odaha baye ukumanya aghala ghayotenda Imulungu kulawa hayakwanzila mbaka hayotsighila. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Nomanya ka kuna chinu chimwe chiliyeka ichinoghile kwa imunu, nacho ukudeng'elela na ukutenda ghanoghile chipindi chose chayokala mgima. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Pfipfila chila munu kobamighwa ukuja, ukunwa na ukudeng'elela aghala ghayopata kulawa mna tsisang'ano tsake tsayotenda kwaapfila acho chinu cha ukugwekighwa kulawa kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Nomanya ka chochose chayotenda Imulungu chokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. Kuduhu ichikongetsighwa wala ichihungutsighwa, Imulungu kotenda apfo ili iwanu wampfuke yeye. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Ichilawila sambi tsachilawila, ichitsolawila hambele ma tsachilawila, naye Imulungu koghatenda aghala ighapfosile ghoye keli.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muisi mduhu haki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Kuya mbona chinu chingi muisi, kuna libalatsa lya ukuhighila, na ghehile ghabaho, na hanu ha ukupata haki, ighehile nagho ghotendeka baho. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Apfo nilongela mna ghumoyo ghwangu nilonga, “Imulungu katsowahigha iwanu iwalihela nzambi na iwehile, kwaapfila keka chipindi chake kwa chila chinu na kwa chila sang'ano.” <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Pfipfila nilongela mna ghumoyo ghwangu ka Imulungu kowaghetsa iwanu, ili webone ka wawo weghala na iwanyama. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Kwaapfila ichiwalawila iwanu chicho ichiwalawila iwanyama, pfayakufa imunu pfipfo pfayakufa imnyama, awo wose wohumula pfipfo, apfo imunu kahela chinu chongetseke cha ukumbita imnyama, agho ghose si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Wose wakufa na woghenda hanu hamwe. Wose wolawa mna litimbwisi, na wose watsakuya mna litimbwisi. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Yuhi iyomanya ka iloho ya imunu yoghuluka mchanya na iloho ya imnyama yohulumka hasi mna lidongo? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Baho nitanga ka kuduhu chinu chinoghile ng'ani kwa imunu kubita ukudeng'elela aghala ghayapatile kulawa mna isang'ano yake, kwaapfila acho chicho chayekilighwe. Yuhi iyodaha kumlongela imunu aghala ighatsolawila yeye hayatsakufa?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Kuya ndola iwanu pfawotendelighwa pfihile muisi. Mbona wolila lekeni haduhu munu wowose wa ukuwakanza. Iwowadidimitsa tsawana ngupfu nyingi lekeni wawo tsawahela ghendo imunu wa ukuwakanza. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Apfo nene nilongela nimwenyegho, “Wabweda awala iwafile kubita awala iwoghendelela kukala wagima. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Lekeni yabwedile kubita awo wose weli ayula yang'ana yoneke, ayo yang'ana yone aghala ighehile ighotendighwa muisi.” <verse eid="ECC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Mbona iwanu pfawohenyeka mna tsing'onde tsawo mbaka wobweda, wobweda kwaapfila chila munu komwonela gele miyaghe, kobama yambite miyaghe. Agho nagho si chinu ghendo, gheghala na ukuwinga libeho. <verse eid="ECC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Imunu mbotsi ng'osang'ana baye, na kotsigha kwa ukwikoma mwenyegho na inzala. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Ng'apfu kukala na chidogho aku ghumoyo ghukala tulu kubita kuwa na pfingi na ghamaghayo. Ukutenda apfo kweghala na ukuwinga libeho. <verse eid="ECC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Kuya mbona chinu chimwe mna isi ichili bule ghendo. ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Nimwona munu kayeka yeka, kahela mwana wala ndughu, naye ng'oleka kusang'ana baye, na tsimali tsayali natso ng'atsimwenela baye, naye ng'eghutsa apfi baye, “Angu nimuhenyekela nani mbaka ndeke kuhomola tsimali tsangu?” Alyo nalyo si chinu ghendo baye ila ukuhenyeka kuliyeka. <verse eid="ECC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Ng'apfu kuwa weli kubita kuwa munu yumwe kwaapfila watsolihighwa pfinoghile kwa isang'ano yawo. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Haitsolawila yumwe kaghwa, miyaghe katsomwinula. Lekeni katsochona ayula iyaliyeka hayatsakughwa na kuduhu munu wa kumwinula. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Pfipfila iwanu weli wang'awasa hamwe wotsumbuka, lekeni imunu yang'awa yaliyeka yodahatse ukutsumbuka? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Munu yumwe kodaha kutsidiwa ngupfu, lekeni wang'awa weli ng'awodaha kutsidiwa ngupfu baye. Mitsabi midatu ing'apfoghosighwa hamwe ng'aisumka ukudumka baye. <verse eid="ECC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Ng'apfu imsongolo mhingwa yana ihekima, kubita mfalume mzehe mbotsi yoleka kutegheletsa aghala ighanoghile ghayokanyighwa, <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />kodaha kuwa mfalume hata ka kolawila kuna ligeletsa, na hata ka iwamweleke tsa wahingwa. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Tsaniwona iwanu wose iwokala muisi, womuwinza imsongolo ayula iyasolile hanu ha mfalume. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Iwanu iyawatawale tsawakala wengi ng'ani. Hata apfo awala iwatsakoneka hambele ng'awatsomdeng'elela baye. Agho nagho bule ghendo, gheghala na ukuwinga libeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Uleke kusumka kwika lilaghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Walangitse haughenda mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, usoghele habei utegheletse kubita ukulapfa nambiko ka pfawolapfa nambiko iwanu iwabotsi, iwanu ing'awamanyile ka wotenda ighehile. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Haulonga tanu wifikitse, wala uleke kuwa na chihumuhumu kulonga chochose hambele ha Imulungu, kwaapfila Imulungu ka kulanga na ghweghwe kwa muisi, apfo uleke kulonga pfinu pfingi. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Ukwalangula pfinu pfingi komtenda imunu yalote, na ukulongalonga komtenda imunu yalonge ubotsi. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Ung'amwikila Imulungu natsili, uleke kukawa kutimitsa, Imulungu ng'onoghelwa na iwabotsi baye. Ghweghwe utimitse inatsili yaumwikile Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Ng'apfu uleke kwika natsili, kubita kwika inatsili kuya uleke kuitimitsa. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Witeghanye chaulonga chileke kukuhonza utende nzambi, kuya uleke kumlongela imtambika wa Imulungu ka tsang'ubamile baye ukutenda apfo. Hebali umtende Imulungu yone maya kwa achila chaulonga na yaihinye isang'ano ya ghamoko ghako? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Ukulotalota tsindoto na ukulongalonga kose bule ghendo, lekeni ghweghwe umpfuke Imulungu.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugima uno si chinu ghendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Haukwona iwanu iwahingwa mna isi wodidimitsighwa, wakwimighwa haki tsawo, uleke kukangawala na ichinu acho, kwaapfila chilongotsi yumwe kololighwa na chilongotsi iyali mkulu wake, nawo pfipfila wololighwa na iwakulu wawo. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Isi haibweda na iwanu wose wobweda, na imfalume mwenyegho kobweda kulawa kuna imighunda. <verse eid="ECC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Imunu iyokunda tsisendi, tsisendi ng'atsimwenela baye, na iyokunda tsimali, hata yang'apata, tsimali ng'atsiwenela baye. Alyo nalyo bule ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Tsimali tsing'ongetseka awala iwakuja nawo wakongetseka. Angu yana tsimali yopata choni? Na imwenyegho yopata choni, ng'ambe kotsilolesa hela? <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Imunu iyosang'ana tsing'onde tsa ukuhenyeka kowasa fofofo, yawe keghuta au ng'eghutile baye, lekeni imunu yana tsimali ketseketse ng'owasa baye, kwaapfila tsimali tsake tsomtenda yakale meso chilo chigima. <verse eid="ECC 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Kuya mbona chinu chimwe mna isi chiha ghendo, imunu yelundikitsila tsimali kwa kwilagha mwenyegho, <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />na tsimali atso tsagha yeye bila kumanya, naye keleka imwana aku kahela chinu chochose cha ukumlekela imwanaghe. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Ka apfila pfayatsile chidako mna isi kulawa muinda mwa mai wake, pfipfo pfayatsakuka, ng'atsodaha baye kusola chinu chochose mna ghamoko ghake kwa isang'ano yake iyaitendile. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Alino nalyo liha ghendo, imunu pfayakutsa pfipfo pfayatsakuka. Angu yabwedile choni imunu iyahenyeke kwa kuliwinga libeho? <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Matsuwa ghose ghayakalile mgima kokala mchisi, aku koghanzika, kamtamu na kakona maya. <verse eid="ECC 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Apfo nene mbona pfinogha imunu yaje, yanwe na yadeng'elele chayopata kwa isang'ano yake iyaihenyekele muisi mna ghamatsuwa ghayeng'ighwe na Imulungu, kwaapfila acho chicho chayekilighwe. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Pfipfila Imulungu komwing'a chila munu tsimali na utajli, na komleka yatsihomole tsimali atso, yalonge mighede na yadeng'ele achila chayapatile kulawa mna ing'onde yake ng'omu. Apfo pfose nzawadi kulawa kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Apfo imunu ng'okumbuka baye chinu chachi ichimlawila mna matsuwa ghose hayokala mgima, kwaapfila Imulungu komleka yadeng'elele hayotenda tsisang'ano tsake.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Nene mbona chinu chimwe chihile mna isi, nacho chowahenya iwanu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Imulungu komwing'a imunu tsimali, utajili na komtenda yatunyighwe, naye ng'ohungukighwa baye na chinu chochose chaghubama ghumoyo ghwake, lekeni Imlungu ng'omleka baye yapfihomole ipfinu apfo, Ila imgheni yuyo iyopfihomola, alyo nalyo si chinu baye na lyodesa ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Imunu kodaha kweleka wana miya imwe na kukala miyaka mingi, lekeni ka imunu ayo ng'apfihomole baye ipfinu pfayapatile hayang'ali mgima, wala ng'atsotsikighwa baye ka munu mkulu, nene nolonga, ng'apfu imwana iyafilile munda, kubita imunu ayo. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Kwaapfila ukwelekighwa kwa imwana ayo bule ghendo, yeye kakwaghila mchisi na ng'akuwa na taghwa baye. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Hata ka imwana ayo ng'onile litsuwa wala ng'atangile chinu chochose, yeye kobwihila tulu kubita imunu ayo. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Na ka imunu ayo kokala miyaka elufu mbili na ukughendelela, lekeni ng'opfihomola baye ipfinu pfayapatile hayakalile mgima, imunu ayo keghala na imwana ayo, wose weli woghenda hanu hamwe. <verse eid="ECC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Imunu keyunda ukusang'ana, ili yapate chijo yaje, lekeni ng'eghuta baye. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Angu imunu yana ihekima yopata choni kumbita imunu mbotsi? Apfi imunu mhingwa yopata choni yang'amanya ukukala pfinoghile mna iwanu? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Ng'apfu ukudeng'elela ichinu ichikoneka na tsinenge kubita ukumwemwetela chakachaka. <verse eid="ECC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Chila chinu ichilawila ma tsaching'ighwa taghwa kulawa ghumwande, na imunu ma kamanyika apfila pfayali, wala kuduhu imunu iyodaha kwihisanya na imunu yana tsingupfu kubita yeye. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Ukulongalonga sideke si chinu baye, nako kumwapfila choni imunu? <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Kwaapfila na yuhi iyomanya ighanoghile mna ghamatsuwa gha imunu hayakuwa mgima, ghamatsuwa ighali si chinu ghendo baye na ighobita ka chimbeho? Yuhi iyodaha kumlongela ighatsolawila yeye hayatsakuwa kahupa muisi?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Ukufikitsa tsimbuli tsa ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Ng'apfu litwagha linoghile kubita mapfuta ighonung'ila. Ng'apfu litsuwa lya ukufa kubita litsuwa lya ukwelekighwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Ng'apfu kughenda kuna ing'anda ina ichililo kubita kughenda kuna ing'anda ina ichihungo, kwaapfila iwanu wose watsakufa, apfo iwanu iwagima wobamighwa alyo walikumbuke. <verse eid="ECC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Ng'apfu ukutsinika kubita ukuseka, kwaapfila ichihanga chitsinika chotenda ghumoyo ghubwede. <verse eid="ECC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Ghumoyo ghwa imunu yana ihekima ghwa mghati mwa ing'anda ina ichililo, lekeni ghumoyo ghwa imunu mbotsi ghwa mghati mwa ing'anda ina ichiseko. <verse eid="ECC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Ng'apfu kuhulika ukukanyighwa na imunu yana ihekima kubita kuhulika wila wa imunu mbotsi. <verse eid="ECC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kwaapfila chiseko cha imunu mbotsi cheghala na tsimiwa itsitananuka mmoto, agho nagho bule ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Ukubunza komtenda imunu yawe mbotsi, na ukubokela hongo kohinya ghumoyo. <verse eid="ECC 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Ukutsigha kwa ichinu kunogha kubita ghumwanduso ghwake. Na iyodudumila mmoyo kanogha kubita yana ichidandali. <verse eid="ECC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Uleke kusumka kona maya, kwaapfila imaya yokala mghati mwa imimoyo ya iwabotsi. <verse eid="ECC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Uleke kulonga, “Hebali matsuwa gha ghumwande tsaghanogha kubita gha sambi?” Kwaapfila ung'aghutsa apfo kwahela hekima. <verse eid="ECC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Ihekima inogha ka ulisi, na inogha kwa awala wose iwali wagima. <verse eid="ECC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Kwaapfila ihekima yodaha kumkinga imunu ka apfila ifetsa pfaidaha kumkinga. Chinu chikulu cha ukumanya, ihekima yokinga ugima wa imunu yalinayo. <verse eid="ECC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Wifikitse tsisang'ano tsa Imulungu, kwaapfila yuhi iyodaha kuchigholosa chayapfedule Imulungu? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha ukubweda, udeng'elele, mna ghamatsuwa ukughanzika wifikitse aghano, kwaapfila agho ghose meli Imulungu kaghatenda ghalawile ili imunu yaleke kumanya ighatsolawila hambele hake. <verse eid="ECC 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghangu gha ugima ighali si chinu baye, nene nighona aghano, kuna imunu iyana ihaki iyakufa aku kotenda ighali gha haki, na kuna imunu iyehile iyokala mgima matsuwa mengi aku koghendelela ukutenda ighehile. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Uleke kuwa imunu yana ihaki kubitilitsa, wala uleke kuwa imunu yana ihekima kubitilitsa. Heule wilagha ghweghwe mwenyegho? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Uleke kuwa imunu yehile yabitilitse, wala uleke kuwa mbotsi! Hebali ufe ng'ana matsuwa ghako ghapfike? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Pfinogha ulikinde lya mwanduso na lya keli uleke kulileka, kwaapfila imunu iyompfuka Imulungu katsoghahepa ghose agho. <verse eid="ECC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Hekima yomtenda imunu yawe na ngupfu ng'ani kubita watawala kumi iwali mna ghumji. <verse eid="ECC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Ona ghendo, kuduhu munu iyana ihaki mna isi iyotenda ghanoghile matsuwa ghose bila ukutenda nzambi. <verse eid="ECC 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Uleke kwika mna ghumoyo ghwako chila chinu chawolonga iwanu hela kutsomuhulika mtumighwa wako imwenyegho kokulighita. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Kwaapfila hata ghweghwe mwenyegho mna ghumoyo ghwako kuwalighitagha iwanu wangi.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Agho ghose nighalinga kwa ihekima, nilongela: “Nobama niwe imunu yana ihekima,” lekeni ihekima yakutali ghendo na nene, <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />ya kutali ng'ani na ipfisika, yuhi iyodaha kuitanga? <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Apfo nighutuka, na ghumoyo ghwangu ghubama niimanye ihekima na ipfinu pfilibaho, na nimanye ka ighehile ubotsi, na ka ubotsi ukalukwale. <verse eid="ECC 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Chinu chimwe chanitangile china usungu ng'ani kubita ukufa, ipinga iyali mtegho na nyonzo, na ghamoko ghake ighali ka minyololo, imunu ayo iyomnoghetsa Imulungu katsomhepa, ila yana tsinzambi katsomwonza. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Lelo muhubili kolonga, “Agho ghagho ghanitangile hanilingile chinu chimwe na chinu chingi. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Haning'ali nighendelela ukubama nitange ipfinu apfo, nitanga keli chinu chimwe. Mna wamale elufu imwe nimwona mmale yumwe yotogholighwa, lekeni mna wapinga wose elufu imwe simwonile baye hata yumwe yotogholighwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Lola! Nitanga chinu chimwe, Imulungu tsakawaumba iwanu wanogha, lekeni wawo webamila ukutenda pfawo wenyegho.”<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Yuhi iyali ka imunu yana ihekima? Yuhi yomanya ipfinu pfapfili? Ihekima yotenda ichihanga cha imunu chidedemke, na yotenda ichihanga acho chileke koneka china usungu.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumtegheletsa Mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Nene nowalongela apfino: Mkinde malaghitso gha mfalume kwaapfila tsakwilaha kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Uleke kusumka kulawa hambele hake, wala uleke kughendelela ukutenda ighehile, kwaapfila mfalume kodaha kutenda chochose ichimnoghela. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Kwaapfila malaghitso gha mfalume ghana ngupfu, yuhi yodaha kumghutsa, “Utenda choni?” <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Iyokinda ghamalaghitso ghake, ighehile ng'aghatsompata baye, na yana ihekima katsomanya ghamatsuwa ighanoghile na apfila pfayatsotenda. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kwaapfila chila chinu chotendeka mna matsuwa ghake, na cholawila kwa nzila yake, hata ka imunu kobita mna maghayo makulu. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Kwaapfila ng'omanya baye ghamatsuwa ighakutsa hambele, lelo yuhi iyodaha kumlongela ighatsolawila? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Kuduhu imunu yodaha kumghoma yaleke ukufa, wala kuduhu iyodaha kughoma litsuwa lyake lya ukufa lileke ukupfika. Ka apfila pfaili kuna ing'ondo imunu ng'odaha baye kuhona baye, na ighehile ng'aghodaha baye kumkombola imunu iyehile.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wehile na iwanu iwanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Ghose aghano nighona haning'ali nifikitsa ighotendighwa mna isi aino, apfila imunu pfayodaha kumdidimitsa miyaghe na kumdununza. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Kuya mbona iwanu iwehile pfawotsikighwa, iwanu iwatsowele kwingila na kulawa hanu helile, awala iwatunyighwe mna imiji iyawang'ali wotendagha ighehile. Alino nalyo si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Ka ighehile ighotendighwa na iwanu ng'aghohighighwa himahima baye, apfo imimoyo ya iwanu nayo yosumkila ukutenda ighehile. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Hata ka imunu yana nzambi katenda ighehile mala miya, naye koghendelela kukala mgima matsuwa mengi, lekeni nene nomanya watsobweda awala iwompfuka Imulungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Lekeni kwaapfila iwanu wehile ng'awompfuka Imulungu baye, wawo ng'awatsobweda baye. Wawo watsakufa wang'ali wadodo. <verse eid="ECC 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Mna isi aino hana chinu chimwe ichitendighwa, iwanu wana ihaki wotendelighwa aghala ghawobamighwa kutendelighwa iwanu wehile, na iwanu wehile watsotendelighwa aghala ghawobamighwa kutendelighwa iwanu wana ihaki. Alino nalyo nolonga si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Apfo nene nokomangitsa iwanu wadeng'elele, kwaapfila ichinu chinoghile ghendo kwa imunu mna isi aino, ukuja, ukunwa na ukudeng'elela. Ukudeng'elela ako kughendelele mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghose ghayeng'ighwe na Imulungu yasang'ane muisi. <verse eid="ECC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Nene hanifikitse nimanye ihekima na ukwona ighotendeka muisi, nitanga kodaha kukala meso chilo na misi, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />baho mbona ghose ghayatendile Imulungu. Kuduhu munu iyomanya aghala ighotendeke muisi. Hata ka imunu kohenyeka yaghamanye, ng'odaha baye kughamanya. Imunu yana ihekima kodaha kulonga koghamanya lekeni kumbe ng'oghamanya ghendo baye.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Apfo nifikitsa na kukaghula kaghula mna agho ghose, kuya nitanga iwanu iwana haki na iwana ihekima na aghala ghose ghawotenda ghamna ghamoko gha Imulungu, na kuduhu iyomanya ka iwanu watsowakunda au watsowohila. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Chinu chimwe chihile chowalawila wose, chomlawila imunu yana ihaki na iyehile, chomlawila imunu iyanoghile na ing'ayanoghile, chomlawila imunu yelile na iyakodotsoke, pfipfila chomlawila iyolapfa nambiko na ing'ayolapfa nambiko. Pfayali Imunu iyanoghile pfipfo pfayali imunu yana tsinzambi, pfayali imunu iyelaha pfipfo pfayali imunu iyopfuka kwilaha. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Alino liha ghendo mna ghose ighotendeka muisi, chinu chimwe chihile chowalawila wose. Pfipfila matsuwa ghose hawakuwa wagima wawo wotenda ghehile, ukalukwale umema mna imimoyo yawo, na hambele wose wakufa. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Imunu wowose iyali hamwe na iwanu wagima ayo kana lolelo, ng'apfu uwe yumbwa iyali mgima kubita kuwa simba yafile. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Kwaapfila iwanu wagima womanya ka watsakufa, lekeni iwafile ng'awomanya chochose baye, wawo ng'awotsoghwekighwa chinu chochose baye kwaapfila wasemwighwa ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Apfila pfawang'ali wowakunda iwanu, na apfila pfawang'ali wowehila iwanu, na apfila pfawang'ali wowonela gele iwanu, kose kuhupa hamwe nawo, wao wahela chinu chochose mna ghose ighotendeka muisi. <verse eid="ECC 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Lelo ghenda ukaje chijo chako aku kodeng'elela, na ukanwe dipfai yako usangalamke kwaapfila Imulungu katsitoghola tsisang'ano tsako. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Matsuwa ghose upfale tsinguwo tsinzelu na wibake ghamapfuta mwitwi. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Ukale ghoya na mwehe wako yumkunda matsuwa ghose, mna matsuwa ghako gha ukudununzika, ghamatsuwa agho ghawing'ighwe na Imulungu mna isi aino, kwaapfila alyo lilyo lyawing'ighwe ahala haukala mgima, na ahala hauhenyeka kusang'ana tsing'onde tsako muisi. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Chochose chubama kutenda, chitende kwa ngupfu tsako tsose, kwaapfila ako kutsimu kwaughenda kuduhu sang'ano, wala kufikitsa, wala ukumanya, wala ihekima. <verse eid="ECC 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Kuya mbona chinu chingi muisi mno, iwohuma mna ukutsuma si awala iwadahile ukutsuma baye, wala iwohuma kung'ondo si awala wana tsingupfu baye, wala iwopata chijo si awala iwana ihekima baye, wala iwopata utajili si awala wana tsimbutsi baye, lekeni tondokela ling'alawila, lyowalawila wose. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Kwaapfila imunu ng'omanya ka agho ghatsolawila tsuwachi, ka apfila iwasomba pfawakonzeka mna wapfu, na wapfideghe pfawakonzeka mna ghumtegho, pfipfo iwanu pfawakonzeka ahala ighehile haghowalawila kwa ukwidukitsa.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihekima inogha kubita tsingupfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Kuya nene niyona ihekima pfaili muisi, ichinu acho nene chinikangawatsa, <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />tsahana mji ghumwe mdodo ghuna iwanu chidogho, kuya katsa mfalume yumwe yana ingupfu kaghutsingila na katsenga ngome ili yaghutowe. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Lekeni mumo mna ghumji tsahana mhinghwa yumwe yana ihekima, kaghukombola ghumji agho kwa ihekima yake. Lekeni kuduhu munu yamkumbuke mhingwa ayo. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Lelo nene nolonga ihekima inogha kubita tsingupfu, hata ka ihekima ya munu mhingwa yobetsighwa, na ghayolonga ng'aghotegheletsighwa baye. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ng'apfu kumtegheletsa imunu yana ihekima iyolonga lughalugha, kubita kumtegheletsa mfalume iyodalamka mna mtingano ghwa iwabotsi. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Ihekima inogha kubita tsisilaha tsa ing'ondo, lekeni munu yumwe yana nzambi kohinya pfinu pfngi ipfinoghile.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Ka apfila wang'onzi iwafile pfawotenda ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya ghanung'e, pfipfo ubotsi chidogho pfauhinya ihekima na iheshima. <verse eid="ECC 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Ghumoyo ghwa munu yana ihekima ghomlongotsa ukutenda ighanoghile, lekeni imunu mbotsi ghumoyo ghwake ghomwaghisa. <verse eid="ECC 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Imunu mbotsi hata yang'anga mnzila komanyika, komlangusa chila munu yamanye ka yeye mbotsi. <verse eid="ECC 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Chilongotsi yang'akughudubukila uleke kuka hanu aho, ukwidika lughalugha kodaha kutenda matotso ghako makulu ghaleghusighwe. <verse eid="ECC 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Kuya mbona chinu chihile ichitendeka muisi, ichinu acho chotendighwa na iwatawala, <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />woweng'a ukulu iwanu wabotsi, na iwanu matajili woweka hasi. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Niwona iwatumwa wodina falasi, na iwakulu woghenda kwa maghulu ka watumwa. <verse eid="ECC 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Yohimba lipondo kodaha kwingila imwenyegho, yobomola ubanda inzoka katsomluma. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Imunu iyotula ghamabwe ghomlagha imwenyegho, na iyobatsula ligogo pfipfila lyomlagha mwenyegho. <verse eid="ECC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Tsobamighwa ngupfu nyingi kwa imunu yotumila hoya dughi, lekeni ukutumila ihekima komtenda imunu yabwede. <verse eid="ECC 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Imunu kodaha kumtenda inzoka yaleke kumluma, lekeni ka inzoka kolongola ukumluma chatendile bule ghendo. <verse eid="ECC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Ghamalonga gha imunu yana ihekima ghomtenda yatogholighwe, lekeni ghamalonga gha imunu mbotsi ghomuhinya imwenyegho. <verse eid="ECC 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Imunu mbotsi kakwandusa kulonga mbuli tsa ubotsi, na komalitsila kulonga kwa ukalukwale wihile. <verse eid="ECC 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Pfipfila imunu mbotsi kolonga chaka, na kuduhu munu iyomanya ighakutsa. Yuhi iyodaha kumlongela ighakutsa na ighatsolawila hayatsakufa? <verse eid="ECC 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Imunu mbotsi kakwipfa kwa isang'ano yake mbaka ng'omanya baye inzila ya kughendela kuna ghumji ghwake. <verse eid="ECC 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Kutsoghaya ghwe isi mfalume wako yang'awa mbwanga, na pfilongotsi wako wang'atenda chihungo matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="ECC 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Kutsobweda ghwe isi mfalume wako yang'awa mwana wa iwanu wakulu, na iwakulu wako wang'aja ichijo mna ichipindi ichitogholeka, ili wapate ngupfu na si kwa ukupatika baye. <verse eid="ECC 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Ka imunu yang'awa mdebwe ichiswili chonyeta, na udebwe ung'ongetseka ing'anda yosulula. <verse eid="ECC 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Chihungo chotendighwa ili iwanu waseke, idipfai yosangalamsa ugima, lekeni ifetsa yotenda imunu yapate chila chinu. <verse eid="ECC 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Mna ghumoyo ghwako uleke kumlighita mfalume, wala uleke kumlighita imunu tajili kuna ichiheleto chako chuwasa, kwaapfila ichideghe wa kulanga katsohulika, na katsoghuluka yawaghalile tsimbuli tsaulonga.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Chayotenda imunu yana ihekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Wagholele iwanu ipfinu pfako kwaapfila matsuwa mengi ighakutsa kutsopata keli. <verse eid="ECC 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Uwagholele wanu saba chawinacho, hata wang'awa wanane, kwaapfila ng'umanya baye chinu chachi chihile chitsolawila mna isi. <verse eid="ECC 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Libingu ling'awa tito imvula yotowa muisi, ghumbiki ghung'aghwila kusini au kasikazini, aho aghukughwila baho haghutsokala. <verse eid="ECC 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Iyololesa libeho pfaliduma ng'atsohanda mbeghu baye, na iyololela libingu pfalili ng'atsopfuna chinu baye. <verse eid="ECC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Ka pfila pfang'umanya libeho libita nzila yachi, au apfila imipate ya mwana mdodo pfaikula munda mwa mai wake, pfipfila ng'aumanya baye tsisang'ano tsayosang'ana Imulungu iyaumbile pfinu pfose. <verse eid="ECC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Nemitondo uhande tsimbeghu, na ahipfika nemihe uleke kwipfa ukuhanda tsimbeghu, kwaapfila ng'umanya baye mbeghu tsihi itsikwota, ka tsa nemitondo au tsanemihe, na tsing'ota tsose itsakuwa pfinogha. <verse eid="ECC 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Ukona ghumwanga kwamta, na pfinogha ghendo tsinenge ukwona litsuwa pfalilawa chila nemitondo. <verse eid="ECC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Imunu yang'akala mgima miyaka mingi, yadeng'elele imiyaka ayo yose iyokala, lekeni yakumbuke matsuwa ighakutsa ghatsakuwa gha ukughaya nagho ghatsakuwa mengi. Ghose ighotsolawila hambele bule ghendo.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwakanye iwasongolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Ghweghwe msongolo, uudeng'elele usongololo wako, ghumoyo ghwako ghukutende udeng'elele mna ghamatsuwa gha usongolo wako. Utende achila chaghubama ghumoyo ghwako na achila chaukona kwa tsinenge tsako. Lekeni umanye ka Imulungu katsokuhigha kwa agho ghose ghautenda. <verse eid="ECC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Apfo uleke kwalangula chinu chochose mna ghumoyo ghwako, na uleke kwalangula apfila ilukuli lwako pfalughaya, kwaapfila usongolo na ukukala miyaka mingi kose si chinu baye.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Umkumbuke Imuumba wako mna ghamatsuwa gha usongolo wako, ng'ana ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya ghapfike, wala ng'ana ipfike baye imiyaka hautsolonga, “Nene sideng'elela keli baye ukuwa mgima.” <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Umkumbuke ng'ana litsuwa na ghumwetsi na tsinondo tsighelighwe chisi na ng'ana libingu lya mvula litine keli. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Umkumbuke ng'ana iwokalitsa ing'anda waghudeme baye, na ng'ana wana tsingupfu wapfeduke mighongo na ng'ana awala iwosagha waleke kusagha kwaapfila wachidogho, na ng'ana iwosungulila ipfonzo ng'awakwona chinu baye. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Mkumbuke Imulungu ng'ana ghamaghutwi ghadiwe baye, ng'ana litsi lya iwanu iwosagha lileke kuhulikika, na ng'ana imunu iyawasile yalamke baye ahala wapfideghe hawolila, na ng'ana iwapinga iwakwimba wawe chidogho. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Umkumbuke ng'ana iwanu wapfuke baye ukugheluka mlughongo, na ng'ana iwanu wapfuke baye ipfinu ipfilagha pfili mzila, na ng'ana mbiki wa mloso ghusanule maluwa baye, na ng'ana ibalangulu yaleke kudaha ukudaluka, na ng'ana libatsu lya ukuja limale, na ng'ana imunu yaighendele ing'anda yake ya ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na ng'ana iwanu iwodomboketsa wabite mna tsinzila. <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Umkumbuke ng'ana lutsabi lwa fetsa ludumke baye, na ng'ana libakuli lya nzahabu litulike baye, na ng'ana ichiha cha ghamatsi chutulike baye hana imbwibwi, na ng'ana lighuludumu lya ukukweghela ghamatsi lihinyike baye. <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Na ilukuli lwako lutsakuya kuna lidongo kwalilawile, na iloho yako itsomwihila Imulungu iyaiumbile. <verse eid="ECC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Nene Muhubili nolonga, “Si chinu ghendo, si chinu ghendo baye. Ghose bule bule ghendo.”<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha ukumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Kwaapfila muhubili tsakana ihekima, kaghendelela kuwalangulitsa iwanu ukumanya, kughalinga na kughasaghanisa, na kutunga mesali nyingi. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Muhubili tsakaghabama ghamalonga gha kweli na kaghapata, na kaghandika agho ghose. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Ghawolonga iwanu wana ihekima gheghala na ing'weku ya ukudimila iwanyama isongolighwe, na ghawolonga ka misumari ikomelelighwe mna mbiki. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Lelo, mwanangu witeghanye! Ukwandika ipfitabu ng'akutsigha baye, na ung'asoma ng'ani ilukuli lwakwipfa. <verse eid="ECC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Ung'aleka agho ghose ghalongighwe, lekeni kuna chinu chingi chobamighwa: Umpfuke Imulungu na kukinda ghamalaghitso ghake mana ayo iyo sang'ano yaumbilighwe imunu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Mana Imulungu katsohigha ghamatendo ghenu ghose na aghala ighotendighwa kwa kwipfisa, ghawe ghanogha au gheha.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>